import std.dl

[a known value|a known value] means: 1

to get [the selection of {integer:left} using alpha|the selection of {integer:right} using beta]:
    return 1

function [the recurrence of|the recurrence of] argument after marker:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", argument)
        the recurrence of marker after marker

print lines (the selection of 1 using alpha) and (the selection of 2 using beta)
